{"version":1,"key":"card:390","content":{"id":390,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态加载远程库的 demo，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 远程加载 CommonJS 的库。思路是在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"window","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象上创建一个临时的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"module","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 远程加载这个库，库会挂载到这个临时对象上，加载成功后从这个临时对象上提取除库的内容返回，从而实现动态加载。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const require = async (url) => {\n  // 保存 window.module 原来的值，用以恢复\n  const _module = window.module;\n  \n  window.module = {};\n  await import(url);\n  // 获取到动态导入的库\n  const exports = window.module.exports;\n  // 恢复 window.module\n  window.module = _module;\n  \n  return exports;\n}\n\nrequire('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/reworkcss/css@latest/lib/parse/index.js').then(mod => {\n  console.log(mod);\n});","language":"js","uuid":"797295d5-5bd3-4b12-a749-81562a25c3bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"demo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，还存在很多问题："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"import()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 导入，这就要求这个库必须能在严格模式下运行"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"仅支持库没有依赖的动态导入"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为是异步导入，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"window.module","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个对象在导入的过程可能被更新，在恢复的过程中这个更新会被丢弃掉"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存在跨域的问题"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"... ..."}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即使是一个 demo，也给出了一些动态加载的思路。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://lea.verou.me/blog/2020/07/import-non-esm-libraries-in-es-modules-with-client-side-vanilla-js/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Import non-ESM libraries in ES Modules, with client-side vanilla JS"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7086791335688028196","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"远程组件加载方案实践"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/技巧/动态加载","技巧/JavaScript"],"createTime":1703429871843,"updateTime":1752924183997,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924183997}}